# build outputs & dependencies are never committed
**/vendor/
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
**/.idea/
*.apk
*.aab
!releases/*.apk
**/.env
**/database/*.sqlite
**/storage/logs/*.log
.DS_Store
backend/bin/

# Windows app icons are source files (electron-builder buildResources), not build output
!windows/build/
!windows/build/**
